SUMMARY:Tumua LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club Sacramento
DTSTAMP:20260802T102122Z
DTSTART:20260801T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\nAbout Tumua\nTumua Tuinei is 
	a stand-up comedian\, podcaster\, former collegiate athlete\, actor\, and 
	social media personality born and raised on the island of Oahu\, Hawaii. W
	ith over 600\,000 combined followers across Instagram\, Facebook\, TikTok\
	, and YouTube\, Tumua has become one of the most beloved voices in Pacific
	 Islander comedy. \nHis comedy is deeply rooted in his Polynesian heritage
	\, family life\, and the everyday experiences of growing up in Hawaii. Tum
	ua’s relatable humor\, infectious energy\, and masterful crowd work have e
	arned him a devoted fanbase that spans the globe. In 2023 alone\, he perfo
	rmed in 22 cities\, 11 states\, and 5 islands — a testament to his rapidly
	 growing popularity. \nKnown for his high-energy performances and ability 
	to connect with audiences of all backgrounds\, Tumua delivers a show that 
	is equal parts hilarious and heartfelt. Fans consistently rave about his c
	rowd interactions and his ability to make every show feel personal and uni
	que. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM (Do
	ors open one hour before the show) \nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacra
	mento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825 \nAge Restriction: 18+ even
	t. Two-beverage minimum per person. No re-entry. \nAbout the Venue\nPunch 
	Line Comedy Club Sacramento is one of the most iconic comedy clubs on the 
	West Coast\, located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, California. With a 
	capacity of approximately 300 guests\, the club offers an intimate setting
	 where every seat feels close to the stage. \nThe venue features a full ba
	r and dining service\, with a two-beverage minimum per guest. The layout i
	s a classic comedy club setup with tiered seating\, ensuring excellent sig
	htlines from every angle. Parking is available in the surrounding area\, a
	nd the club is easily accessible from major Sacramento thoroughfares. \nPu
	nch Line Sacramento has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy and is 
	known for its warm\, welcoming atmosphere and top-notch sound system. Whet
	her you’re a first-timer or a regular\, the Punch Line delivers a world-cl
	ass comedy experience every night. \nWhat to Expect\nTumua’s live show is 
	a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud experience from start to finish. Expect ple
	nty of crowd work\, personal stories about his Hawaiian upbringing\, famil
	y life\, and the unique experience of being a Polynesian comedian navigati
	ng the mainland comedy circuit. \nThe show typically runs approximately 90
	 minutes and features an opening act before Tumua takes the stage. Audienc
	e members are encouraged to arrive early to grab drinks and get settled be
	fore the show begins. This is an 18+ event with a two-beverage minimum. \n
	Ticket Information\nPrice Range: $38 – $65 (includes fees) \nPurchase offi
	cial tickets directly through Ticketmaster\, or find resale tickets throug
	h VividSeats for flexible options including quantity selection. \nOfficial
	 Tickets\nResale Tickets\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a co
	mmission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you
	. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may 
	be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/tumua-live-at-p
	unch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
