	 Wild Horse Pass\nGet ready for an unforgettable night of laughter as Jo K
	oy brings his high-energy stand-up comedy show to The Showroom at Gila Riv
	er Resorts and Casinos Wild Horse Pass in Chandler\, Arizona on Saturday\,
	 August 1\, 2026. One of the most beloved comedians in the world\, Jo Koy 
