DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nBill Burr is one of the
	 most celebrated stand-up comedians of his generation — a fearless\, bruta
	lly honest performer whose comedy cuts through the noise with razor-sharp 
	observations about modern life\, masculinity\, relationships\, and society
	. Known for his explosive delivery and willingness to tackle any topic\, B
	urr has earned a massive global fanbase and is widely regarded as one of t
	he greatest stand-up comedians working today. \nBill is the creator and st
	ar of the animated Netflix series F Is for Family\, a recurring cast membe
	r on Breaking Bad and The Mandalorian\, and has released multiple critical
	ly acclaimed stand-up specials on Netflix including Paper Tiger\, Walk You
	r Way Out\, and I’m Sorry You Feel That Way. His Monday Morning Podcast is
	 one of the most downloaded comedy podcasts in the world. \nSeeing Bill Bu
	rr live at Dolby Live in Las Vegas is a bucket-list comedy experience. His
	 large-venue shows are legendary — high-energy\, unpredictable\, and absol
	utely hilarious from start to finish. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, 
	August 1\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Dolby Live at Park MGM\, 3770 S Las
	 Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minute
	s\nImportant: This is a phone-free experience. All phones will be secured 
	in Yondr pouches upon entry. Ticket resale is not permitted for this event
	.\n\nAbout the Venue\nDolby Live at Park MGM is one of Las Vegas’s premier
	 entertainment venues\, located at 3770 S Las Vegas Blvd inside the Park M
	GM resort. With a capacity of approximately 5\,200 guests\, Dolby Live is 
	an intimate arena-style venue that delivers an exceptional concert and com
	edy experience with world-class acoustics and sightlines. \nThe venue feat
	ures state-of-the-art Dolby Atmos sound technology\, making it one of the 
	best-sounding rooms in Las Vegas. The layout includes floor seating\, rese
	rved lower bowl seats\, and upper level sections\, all designed to provide
	 an immersive experience. Full bar and concession service is available thr
	oughout the venue. \nPark MGM is conveniently located on the Las Vegas Str
	ip with valet and self-parking available. The venue is easily accessible f
	rom the Strip and connected to the T-Mobile Arena via the Park entertainme
	nt district. \nWhat to Expect\nBill Burr’s Las Vegas show is a full-scale 
	stand-up production at one of the Strip’s most impressive venues. Expect a
	 high-energy\, no-holds-barred performance covering everything from curren
	t events to personal stories\, all delivered with Burr’s signature intensi
	ty and comedic genius. \nThis is a phone-free event — all phones will be p
	laced in Yondr pouches at the door\, creating an undistracted\, fully pres
	ent audience experience that makes the show even more electric. Anyone see
	n using a device during the performance will be escorted out. \nThe show r
	uns approximately 90 minutes. This is a rare opportunity to see one of com
	edy’s biggest stars in an intimate arena setting in Las Vegas — don’t miss
	 it. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: From $133 (fees may apply) \nNote:
	 Ticket resale is NOT approved for this event. Only official Ticketmaster 
	tickets are valid. Do not purchase from unauthorized resellers. \nTickets 
	are available exclusively through Ticketmaster. This show is expected to s
	ell out — secure your seats now! \nOfficial Tickets \nThis post contains a
	ffiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps
	://comedycalendar.com/event/bill-burr-live-at-dolby-live-las-vegas/\n\nFro
	m Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/bill-burr-live-at-dolby-live-las-vegas
	/
