DTSTAMP:20260802T102123Z
DTSTART:20260801T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Aries Spea
	rs\nAries Spears is one of the most versatile and electrifying comedians w
	orking today. Born in Chicago and raised in New Jersey\, Aries has been pe
	rforming stand-up since the age of 14\, building a reputation as a fearles
	s\, no-holds-barred comedian with an extraordinary gift for impressions an
	d character work. \nHe is best known for his eight seasons on the legendar
	y sketch comedy series MAD TV\, where his dead-on impressions of Michael J
	ackson\, Kanye West\, Eddie Murphy\, Shaquille O’Neal\, and many others ma
	de him one of the show’s most beloved cast members. His stand-up specials 
	include Hollywood\, Look I’m Smiling (Showtime\, 2011) and Comedy Blueprin
	t (2016)\, both showcasing his raw\, unfiltered comedic style. \nAries bri
	ngs an explosive energy to every live performance — expect rapid-fire impr
	essions\, sharp social commentary\, and crowd interaction that keeps the e
	ntire room on its feet. This is a must-see show for any comedy fan. \nEven
	t Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nDoors Open: 7:00 PM\nShow Tim
	e: 8:00 PM\nVenue: The Factory\, 17105 North Outer 40 Road\, Chesterfield\
	, MO 63141\nAge Restriction: All Ages\nTicket Prices: $35 – $103 \nAbout T
	he Factory\nThe Factory is one of St. Louis’s premier mid-size entertainme
	nt venues\, located in Chesterfield\, Missouri — just a short drive from d
	owntown St. Louis. With a capacity of approximately 2\,500\, The Factory o
	ffers an intimate yet energetic atmosphere that’s perfect for stand-up com
	edy shows. \nThe venue features excellent sightlines from virtually every 
	angle\, a full bar and concessions\, and a general admission floor with re
	served seating options available. The sound system is top-notch\, ensuring
	 every punchline lands crystal clear. Parking is available on-site\, with 
	premium parking passes available for purchase. \nThe Factory has quickly b
	ecome one of the most beloved live entertainment destinations in the St. L
	ouis metro area\, hosting national touring acts across comedy\, music\, an
	d more. \nWhat to Expect\nAries Spears delivers a high-octane\, laugh-out-
	loud performance from the moment he hits the stage. His live show is a mas
	terclass in stand-up comedy — blending sharp observational humor\, fearles
	s social commentary\, and his legendary celebrity impressions into a seaml
	ess\, non-stop comedic experience. \nExpect adult language and mature them
	es throughout. Aries doesn’t pull punches — his comedy is raw\, real\, and
	 relentlessly funny. Whether you’ve been a fan since his MAD TV days or yo
	u’re discovering him for the first time\, this show will leave you in tear
	s from laughing. \nArrive early to grab drinks and get your spot. Doors op
	en at 7:00 PM\, one hour before showtime. \nTicket Information\nTickets ra
	nge from $35 to $103 depending on seat location. Official tickets are avai
	lable through Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are available through VividSeat
	s. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. 
	We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalenda
	r.com/event/aries-spears-live-at-the-factory/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/aries-spears-live-at-the-factory/
