	 Atlantic City\, NJ 08401\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome (under 18 mus
	t be accompanied by an adult)\nParking: \nAbout Nikki Glaser\nNikki Glaser
	 is one of the most celebrated stand-up comedians working today\, known fo
