DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Josh Johnson\nJosh Johns
	on is a critically acclaimed stand-up comedian and writer best known for h
	is work on The Daily Show with Trevor Noah. His sharp\, incisive comedy ta
	ckles race\, politics\, and culture with a wit and intelligence that has e
	arned him widespread acclaim. His Comedy Band Camp is a unique live event 
	that blends stand-up with a curated lineup of comedic talent. \nJosh’s com
	edy is thoughtful\, precise\, and brilliantly funny — the kind of stand-up
	 that makes you laugh and think at the same time. His Comedy Band Camp for
	mat promises a full evening of top-tier comedy from multiple performers\, 
	making it one of the most exciting shows of the summer. \nEvent Details\nD
	ate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nTime: 8:30 PM (Late Show) — Early show at
	 5:00 PM also available\nVenue: Taft Theatre\nAddress: 317 East 5th Street
	\, Cincinnati\, OH 45202 \nAbout Taft Theatre\nTaft Theatre is one of Cinc
	innati’s most beloved historic venues\, originally opened in 1928. With a 
	capacity of approximately 2\,500\, it offers an intimate and elegant atmos
	phere that makes every performance feel special. The theatre’s ornate inte
	rior\, excellent acoustics\, and central downtown location make it a favor
	ite for both performers and audiences. \nLocated at 317 East 5th Street in
	 downtown Cincinnati\, Taft Theatre is surrounded by restaurants and parki
	ng options. Note: there are no elevators in the theatre\, and balcony seat
	s require climbing stairs. \nWhat to Expect\nJosh Johnson’s Comedy Band Ca
	mp is a multi-comedian showcase running approximately 2 hours. Expect Josh
	 Johnson headlining alongside a hand-picked lineup of talented comedians f
	or a full evening of laughs. This is a unique format that delivers more co
	medy per dollar than almost any other show on tour. \nDoors open at 7:30 P
	M for the late show. Arrive early to grab drinks and find your seats. An e
	arly show at 5:00 PM is also available on the same date. \nTicket Informat
	ion\nPrice Range: $35 – $85 (plus fees) \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \
	nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra 
	cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-johnsons-comedy-band
	-camp-live-at-taft-theatre/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-johnsons-comedy-band-camp-live-at
	-taft-theatre/
