SUMMARY:Mike E. Winfield LIVE at Chicago Improv
DTSTAMP:20260802T102123Z
DTSTART:20260802T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nMike E. Winfield is one of the most beloved and relatable stand-up co
	medians working today. Known for his warm\, self-deprecating humor and his
	 ability to find comedy in the everyday struggles of family life\, Winfiel
	d has built a devoted national following through his live performances and
	 television appearances. \nHe is best known for his breakout moment on Ame
	rica’s Got Talent Season 17\, where he wowed the judges to a standing ovat
	ion and four yes votes. He returned for America’s Got Talent: All-Stars\, 
	where Simon Cowell hit the Golden Buzzer for his performance. His signatur
	e “StepMAN” bit about being a stepdad has become a fan favorite and anchor
	s his Amazon Original special Mike E. Winfield: StepMan. \nWinfield has al
	so appeared on The Late Show with David Letterman\, Showtime’s Comics With
	out Borders\, Comicview on BET\, and Comedy Central’s Live at Gotham. He s
	tarred in the feature film PIMP opposite Keke Palmer and the late DMX. His
	 comedy is clean\, family-friendly\, and packed with sharp observations ab
	out real life. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, August 2\, 2026\nShow Tim
	e: 6:00 PM CDT (Doors open at 4:00 PM)\nVenue: Chicago Improv\nAddress: 5 
	Woodfield Mall K120B\, Schaumburg\, IL 60173\nAge Restriction: 21+ only. V
	alid ID required at entry.\nTicket Prices: $20 GA (plus fees)\nNote: Two-i
	tem minimum purchase per person in the showroom. No photography or video r
	ecording during the show. All sales are final.\n\nAbout the Venue\nChicago
	 Improv is the Chicago area’s premier comedy club\, located inside the Woo
	dfield Mall in Schaumburg\, Illinois — just 30 miles northwest of downtown
	 Chicago. Part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club chain\, Chi
	cago Improv has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy for de
	cades. \nThe showroom features general admission seating with host-escorte
	d placement\, ensuring every guest gets a great view of the stage. The int
	imate club atmosphere puts you right in the middle of the action\, with a 
	full bar and a mandatory two-item minimum per guest. VIP and premium booth
	 seating is available for groups\, offering a more exclusive experience. \
	nThe venue is easily accessible from I-90 and Route 53\, with ample parkin
	g available throughout the Woodfield Mall complex. The surrounding mall of
	fers plenty of dining and shopping options for a complete night out in the
	 suburbs. Chicago Improv is a 21+ venue for all shows. \nWhat to Expect\nT
	his is a solo headlining stand-up performance by Mike E. Winfield. Expect 
	a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud evening filled with his signature storytell
	ing about family life\, relationships\, and the hilarious challenges of be
	ing a stepdad. Winfield’s comedy is warm\, relatable\, and endlessly funny
	 — the kind of show that leaves you quoting jokes for weeks. \nWinfield is
	 known for his incredible crowd work and his ability to connect with every
	 person in the room. His shows feel personal and spontaneous\, even when d
	elivering polished material. This is a rare chance to see one of comedy’s 
	most beloved performers in an intimate club setting. Arrive early to grab 
	a drink and a great seat before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPri
	ce: $20 GA (plus $7.02 fees\, including tax — total $27.02) \nTickets are 
	available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). This is
	 a 21+ event. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges. \nOfficial Ti
	cketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a co
	mmission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/mike
	-e-winfield-live-at-chicago-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/mike-e-winfield-live-at-chicago-improv
	/
LOCATION:Chicago Improv\, 5 Woodfield Mall\, Schaumburg\, IL\, 60173\, USA
