	 PM)\nVenue: Wells Hall at The Parker (Lillian S. Wells Hall)\nAddress: 70
	7 NE 8th Street\, Fort Lauderdale\, FL 33304\nAge Requirement: All ages we
	lcome\nLanguage: Performance in Portuguese \nAbout Whindersson Nunes\nWhin
	dersson Nunes is one of the biggest Brazilian comedians in the world\, rec
	ognized for his unique\, authentic\, and unpredictable comedic style. Afte
	r 4 years away from the U.S.\, he returns with a brand-new tour that combi
	nes smart comedy\, personal stories\, improvisation\, and reflections abou
