SUMMARY:Mike Vecchione LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260802T102123Z
DTSTART:20260802T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nMike Vec
	chione is a New York City-based comedian who has been performing in the ci
	ty and across the country for more than 20 years. A former special educati
	on teacher\, Mike got his start in Philadelphia before moving to the Big A
	pple\, where he has earned the respect of the industry\, comedy clubs\, an
	d his fellow comedians. \nMike has a sarcastic\, joke-heavy style combined
	 with sharp writing and an understated delivery that leaves audiences in s
	titches. His one-hour special The Attractives\, directed and produced by f
	riend and fellow comic Nate Bargatze\, was shot in Nashville and is one of
	 the premiere comedy specials of 2023. He followed that up with his newest
	 special Low Income White — a sharp\, fast-paced hour that delivers big la
	ughs through everyday observations and personal quirks. \nMike Vecchione i
	s widely regarded as one of the most precise and consistent joke writers i
	n comedy today. His ability to craft perfectly structured jokes with unexp
	ected punchlines is what sets him apart from the crowd. \nEvent Details\n\
	nDate: Sunday\, August 2\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 6:00 
	PM CDT\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\, San 
	Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event — Valid photo ID required\n
	\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Loud Comedy Club is San Antonio’s premier sta
	nd-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loo
	p 410 and Blanco — just inside the loop and only a few miles from the airp
	ort. \nThe club features a full bar lounge where guests can grab a drink b
	efore the show\, and a comfortable showroom with first-come\, first-served
	 seating. Preferred Tables are located center stage for the best views\, w
	hile General Admission tables are positioned on the sides and wings. \nThe
	re is a 2-item food or beverage minimum per person once seated\, and an 18
	% service charge applies to all checks in the showroom. Early arrival is s
	trongly recommended to secure your preferred seating. \nWhat to Expect\nMi
	ke Vecchione delivers a masterclass in joke writing — every line is crafte
	d with precision\, every punchline lands with impact. His sarcastic\, unde
	rstated delivery makes the jokes hit even harder\, and his ability to find
	 humor in the mundane details of everyday life is truly remarkable. \nThis
	 is a solo headlining show in an intimate club setting. Fans of sharp\, we
	ll-crafted stand-up comedy will be thoroughly entertained from start to fi
	nish. Mike’s shows are consistently praised by both audiences and fellow c
	omedians alike. \nDon’t miss this Sunday night show at Laugh Out Loud Come
	dy Club — grab your tickets now! \nTicket Information\n\nGeneral Admission
	: $20 (+ fees)\nPreferred Seating: $30 (+ fees)\nOrder Limit: 10 tickets p
	er order\n\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affilia
	te links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links a
	t no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to chang
	e. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com
	/event/mike-vecchione-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy C
	alendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/mike-vecchione-live-at-laugh-out-loud-
	comedy-club/
