SUMMARY:Nate Bargatze: Big Dumb Eyes World Tour LIVE at KeyBank Center
DTSTAMP:20260802T102123Z
DTSTART:20260802T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nNate Barg
	atze is one of the hottest names in stand-up comedy today. Known as “The G
	reat American” comedian\, Bargatze has built a massive following with his 
	clean\, relatable humor that appeals to audiences of all ages and backgrou
	nds. \nA Nashville native and son of a clown-turned-magician\, Nate’s come
	dy draws from his Southern upbringing\, family life\, and everyday observa
	tions. His Netflix specials — including The Tennessee Kid\, The Greatest A
	verage American\, and Hello World — have made him one of the most-watched 
	comedians on the platform. \nThe Big Dumb Eyes World Tour is his most ambi
	tious tour yet\, bringing his signature laid-back storytelling style to ar
	enas across the globe. Don’t miss your chance to see Nate Bargatze live in
	 Buffalo! \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 2\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM 
	\nVenue: KeyBank Center\, One Seymour H. Knox III Plaza\, Buffalo\, NY 142
	03 \nImportant: KEYBANK CENTER BAG POLICY — ALL BAGS\, BACKPACKS\, AND PUR
	SES ARE PROHIBITED. Please plan accordingly. \nAbout the Venue\nKeyBank Ce
	nter is Buffalo’s premier sports and entertainment arena\, home to the Buf
	falo Sabres NHL team. Located at One Seymour H. Knox III Plaza in downtown
	 Buffalo\, the arena seats approximately 19\,000 for concerts and major ev
	ents. \nThe venue offers a world-class entertainment experience with state
	-of-the-art sound and lighting systems\, multiple concession areas\, and e
	xcellent sightlines from every section. The arena is designed to deliver a
	n immersive experience whether you’re in the lower bowl or the upper deck.
	 \nKeyBank Center is easily accessible from downtown Buffalo and is served
	 by multiple parking garages and surface lots nearby. The venue is also ac
	cessible via public transit. Note that all bags\, backpacks\, and purses a
	re prohibited per venue policy — plan to travel light. \nWhat to Expect\nN
	ate Bargatze’s arena shows are known for being family-friendly\, high-ener
	gy\, and laugh-out-loud funny from start to finish. His clean comedy style
	 means this is a show you can bring the whole family to enjoy. \nExpect a 
	full-length headlining set featuring all-new material from the Big Dumb Ey
	es World Tour. Bargatze’s storytelling is effortless and warm\, drawing yo
	u in with relatable tales before delivering perfectly timed punchlines tha
	t have the whole arena roaring. \nThis is a rescheduled show — all previou
	sly purchased tickets remain valid. Arrive early to find your seats and en
	joy the pre-show atmosphere at KeyBank Center. \nTicket Information\nPrice
	 Range: $45 – $150 (plus fees) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaste
