SUMMARY:S.F. Comedy Showcase LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club - San Francisco
DTSTAMP:20260802T102123Z
DTSTART:20260802T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nThe S.F. Comedy Showcase is San Francisco’s premier weekly stand-up c
	omedy event\, hosted at the legendary Punch Line Comedy Club. Each showcas
	e brings together a rotating lineup of some of the best local Bay Area com
	edians alongside nationally touring acts\, making every show a unique and 
	unpredictable night of laughs. \nThe showcase has been a cornerstone of th
	e San Francisco comedy scene for decades\, serving as a launching pad for 
	emerging talent and a regular stop for established comics looking to work 
	out new material. The format is fast-paced and diverse — expect multiple p
	erformers across a range of styles\, from sharp observational humor to sto
	rytelling\, crowd work\, and everything in between. \nWhether you’re a com
	edy superfan or just looking for a fun Sunday night out\, the S.F. Comedy 
	Showcase delivers consistent\, high-quality entertainment in one of the ci
	ty’s most beloved venues. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, August 2\, 202
	6\nShow Time: 7:30 PM\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\nAddr
	ess: 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94111\nAge Restriction: 18+ (
	2 Beverage Minimum)\nTicket Prices: From $21.80 (General Admission)\n\nAbo
	ut the Venue\nThe Punch Line Comedy Club in San Francisco is one of the mo
	st iconic comedy venues on the West Coast. Nestled at 444 Battery Street i
	n the Financial District\, this intimate club has been a cornerstone of th
	e Bay Area comedy scene since the late 1970s. With a capacity of approxima
	tely 300 guests\, the room offers an up-close\, personal comedy experience
	 that larger venues simply can’t match. \nThe club features tiered seating
	 with cocktail tables\, a full bar\, and a warm\, inviting atmosphere that
	 makes every show feel like a special occasion. The stage is low and close
	 to the audience\, creating an electric connection between performers and 
	the crowd. Parking is available in nearby garages on Battery and Front Str
	eets\, and the venue is conveniently located near the Embarcadero BART sta
	tion. \nThe Punch Line is an 18+ venue with a two-drink minimum. Doors typ
	ically open 60–90 minutes before showtime\, so arrive early to grab a grea
	t seat and a drink before the laughs begin. \nWhat to Expect\nThe S.F. Com
	edy Showcase is a multi-comedian lineup show\, meaning you’ll see several 
	performers take the stage throughout the evening. Each comic brings their 
	own unique voice and style\, creating a dynamic\, varied night of entertai
	nment that keeps the energy high from start to finish. \nThis is the perfe
	ct event for groups\, date nights\, or anyone looking to discover new come
	dy talent. The showcase format means there’s something for everyone — whet
	her you prefer sharp one-liners\, long-form storytelling\, or high-energy 
	crowd interaction. Expect approximately 90 minutes of non-stop comedy in o
	ne of San Francisco’s most beloved rooms. \nTicket Information\nTickets st
	art at $21.80 for General Admission (18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum). Preferred 
	Premium seating is also available. Tickets are available through Ticketmas
	ter (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n
	\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/sf-comedy-showcase-live-at-punch-line-c
	omedy-club-san-francisco/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/sf-comedy-showcase-live-at-punch-line-
	comedy-club-san-francisco/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\, 444 Battery Street\, San 
	Francisco\, California\, 94111\, United States Of America
